  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to occupation of the development hereby approved, a minimum of one bee nesting bricks and one Swift nesting bricks and/or boxes shall be provided. The Swift nesting bricks and/or boxed should be placed at least 5m above the ground with a 5m unobstructed flight path, both below and in front of the swift brick. The Swift bricks and/or boxes should not be placed immediately above doors or windows. The bee and Swift bricks/boxes shall be retained thereafter in perpetuity.REASON: To support bird populations, including swifts, in Hackney and preserve endangered urban biodiversity, by providing nesting opportunities, in accordance with Hackney’s Local Plan LP33 policy LP47 which states that all development schemes involving buildings with an eaves height or roof commencement height of 5 metres and above are required to provide nesting boxes for swifts, sparrows, starlings, as appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The roof of the extension (other than designated external amenity spaces) hereby approved shall not be used as a terrace, balcony or similar amenity area.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\nREASON: In the interests of neighbours amenity\r\n&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to the first use of the roof terrace, a 1.1m high balustrade, as shown on drawings PP/16.E, PP/17.E, PP/21.E, PP/PP/10.E &amp;amp;PP/11.E, shall be installed and retained in perpetuity, unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interests of neighbours amenity&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>"
  ],
